From: Lukasz Madej <l.madej@grinn-global.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] OV5647: disable horizontal mirror and fix Bayer phase

The sensor init tables enable the horizontal mirror bit (0x3821 bit1),
so the image from the CSI camera is delivered flipped left-to-right on
the grinn-astra boards. The Verisilicon ISP path on SL1680 does not
expose any mirror or flip control (neither the kernel device tree, the
/proc/vsi/isp_subdev0 string, the sensor XML/JSON nor the vvcam procfs
interface), so the orientation is corrected here, at the sensor.

The mirror bit is cleared while the horizontal binning bit (0x3821 bit2)
is kept. The vertical flip (0x3820 bit1) is left untouched because only
the left-to-right mirror is wrong.

Clearing the mirror bit shifts the horizontal Bayer phase by one pixel,
which turns the reported GRBG order into RGGB. The bayerPattern of both
modes is updated accordingly, otherwise the ISP reads the red and green
pixels swapped. The bayer order is taken from the driver caps, not from
the OV5647 XML, so the fix belongs here.

Signed-off-by: Lukasz Madej <l.madej@grinn-global.com>
---
 OV5647/source/OV5647.c            | 4 ++--
 OV5647/include_priv/OV5647_priv.h | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/OV5647/source/OV5647.c b/OV5647/source/OV5647.c
--- a/OV5647/source/OV5647.c
+++ b/OV5647/source/OV5647.c
@@ -46,7 +46,7 @@
         .fps       = 60 * ISI_FPS_QUANTIZE,
         .hdrMode  = ISI_SENSOR_MODE_LINEAR,
         .bitWidth = 10,
-        .bayerPattern = ISI_BPAT_GRBG,
+        .bayerPattern = ISI_BPAT_RGGB,
         .afMode = ISI_SENSOR_AF_MODE_NOTSUPP,
         .mipiLane = ISI_MIPI_2LANES,
         .dphyFreq = 280000,
@@ -68,7 +68,7 @@
         .fps      = 30 * ISI_FPS_QUANTIZE,
         .hdrMode = ISI_SENSOR_MODE_LINEAR,
         .bitWidth = 10,
-        .bayerPattern = ISI_BPAT_GRBG,
+        .bayerPattern = ISI_BPAT_RGGB,
         .afMode = ISI_SENSOR_AF_MODE_NOTSUPP,
         .mipiLane = ISI_MIPI_2LANES,
         .dphyFreq = 408000,
diff --git a/OV5647/include_priv/OV5647_priv.h b/OV5647/include_priv/OV5647_priv.h
--- a/OV5647/include_priv/OV5647_priv.h
+++ b/OV5647/include_priv/OV5647_priv.h
@@ -99,5 +99,5 @@
     {0x3036, 0x46},
     {0x303c, 0x11},
-    {0x3821, 0x07},// mirror
+    {0x3821, 0x05},// mirror off (h-binning kept)
     {0x3820, 0x42},// flip
     {0x370c, 0x03},
@@ -195,5 +195,5 @@
     {0x303c, 0x11},
     {0x3106, 0xf5},
-    {0x3821, 0x06},
+    {0x3821, 0x04},// mirror off (h-binning kept)
     {0x3820, 0x42},
     {0x3827, 0xec},
